{
  "name": "WF-5 — Proof of Cleaning Submission",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-5 — Setup Checklist\n\n**Credentials required in n8n before activating:**\n\n1. `Supabase Mr Brush`\n   - Type: **Supabase API**\n   - Host: https://bstohwxzufebufbybxtd.supabase.co\n   - Service Role: your `service_role` secret key\n\n2. `Google Translate — Mr Brush`\n   - Type: **Google Service Account**\n   - Paste JSON key file contents\n   - Tick: Set up for use in HTTP Request node\n   - Allowed domain: translation.googleapis.com\n\n**After activating:**\n- Copy the **Production** Webhook URL\n- Set as `VITE_N8N_WEBHOOK_URL` in the app `.env`\n- Restart the dev server\n\n**Payload received from app:**\n```\n{\n  cleaner_id, job_id, zone_id,\n  image_urls[], note, timestamp\n}\n```\n\n**What this workflow does:**\n1. Fetches supervisor_id + company_id from jobs table\n2. Inserts cleaning_logs row\n3. Inserts evidence_files (one per photo)\n4. Updates job_zones.status → completed\n5. Inserts supervisor notification\n6. Translates note → note_translated via Google Translate (if note exists)",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-280, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "proof-of-cleaning",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 300],
      "webhookId": "a0b1c2d3-e4f5-6789-abcd-ef0123456701"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "jobs",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.body.job_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get Job Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Supabase Mr Brush"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "cleaning_logs",
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "job_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.job_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "cleaner_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.cleaner_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "job_zone_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.zone_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "company_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Get Job Details').item.json.company_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "note",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.note }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "status",
              "fieldValue": "pending"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Insert Cleaning Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [740, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Supabase Mr Brush"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Map each image URL into a separate evidence_files row.\n// The Supabase node below runs once per output item.\nconst cleaningLogId = $('Insert Cleaning Log').first().json.id;\nconst imageUrls = $('Webhook').first().json.body.image_urls;\n\nif (!Array.isArray(imageUrls) || imageUrls.length === 0) {\n  return [];\n}\n\nreturn imageUrls.map(url => ({\n  json: {\n    cleaning_log_id: cleaningLogId,\n    public_url: url\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Build Evidence Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [980, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "evidence_files",
        "dataToSend": "autoMapInputData",
        "options": {}
